# Netlify Fallback Redirects for Incremental Localisations
# Note: Rules without "!" are shadow-fallback rules (only triggered when no static file exists on disk).
# Uses HTTP 302 (Temporary Redirect) to preserve SEO indexability for future translations.

# 1. Regional Context -> Base Language Fallbacks
/es-uy/*   /es/:splat   302
/es-gb/*   /es/:splat   302

# 2. Base Language -> Default English Root Fallbacks
/es/*      /:splat      302
/fr/*      /:splat      302
/de/*      /:splat      302
